		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>40-foot-long, jet-black wingless dragon covered with spines. Two forearms with razor-sharp claws.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +6 (2d8) and 2 claws +6 (2d6) or 1 shocking vapor breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Curse</strong>. When slain, death curses the slayer. WIS 15+ or takes double damage from lightning.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shocking Vapor Breath</strong>. Fills a near-sized cube extending from linnorm. CON 15+ on turn or 2d6 damage. Vapor stays for 3 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Thunderblood</strong>. Lightning immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
